resources close in reverse order:
  opened first
  opened second
  used first
  used second
  closing second
  closing first
a failure in the body wins; close failures are suppressed:
  opened resource
  used resource
  closing resource
caught     : IllegalArgumentException: the body failed
suppressed : IllegalStateException: close failed for resource
with no body failure, the close failure is thrown:
  opened resource
  used resource
  closing resource
caught     : IllegalStateException: close failed for resource
suppressed count: 0
